# Assault Formation: "{2}{G}: Creatures you control get +0/+1 until end of turn." The effect affects the creatures its
# controller has as it resolves and no others (CR 611.2c): on turn 3 Bot1 pays it with one Llanowar Elves on the
# battlefield, then casts a second Elves. The first is a 1/2 until end of turn, the second a 1/1 that was not there to be
# affected, and Bot2's Elves is untouched. On Bot2's turn the first Elves is a 1/1 again.

